==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|چوجق|tr=çocuk|t=pigling; child}}, from {{der|tr|trk-pro|*čōč-|t=child; young pig}}; from which also {{m|trk-pro|*čōčka||pig}}.

Cognate with {{cog|az|çocuq||child}}, {{cog|uz|jujuq||small child}}, {{cog|otk|𐰲𐰆𐰲𐰸|tr=čočuk|t=piglet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|[t͡ʃo̞ˈd͡ʒuk]}}
* {{audio|tr|Tr tr çocuk.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{tr-noun|çocuğu|lar}}

# [[child]]
# a male around [[dating]] age
#: {{ux|tr|Dün gece bana DM'den mesaj atan '''çocuğu''' hatırlıyor musun?|Do you remember the '''guy''' who DMed me last night?}}

